  "body": "Hurry to this fantastic freehold family home in a highly sought-after location, with two iconic beaches close by!\r\n\r\nSnapshot:\r\n• 3 double bedrooms + a study\r\n• 2.5 bathrooms\r\n• 2 living areas\r\n• Separate laundry space\r\n• Outdoor entertaining area\r\n• Internal access garage and off street parking\r\n\r\nEnjoy enhanced privacy and peace as the last home on the block whilst still being super close to everything that matters!\r\n\r\nTop School Zone: Zoned for Bucklands Beach Intermediate (BBI) and Macleans College.\r\nWalk to School: Both schools are within walking distance, making school runs a thing of the past.\r\nConvenient Lifestyle: Close to sports facilities, stunning beaches, parks and one of the area's largest supermarkets, with everything you need just minutes away.\r\n\r\nCall Mayank right now to view - our Vendors' plans have been set in motion, and this MUST SELL!",
